      "h2": "What we charge, said plainly.",
      "p": "Pradip Bhattacharya started this office in 2011 after ten years with a builder in Salt Lake. The rule from day one: tell the customer the fee before the first visit, and never add anything to it later.",
      "h3": "What you pay",
