            "step": "Step 3",
            "h3": "Visit, on a day that suits you",
            "p": "We fix a time with the owner and come with you. Weekends and evenings are fine. Two or three flats in one trip, so you can compare them."
          },
          {
            "step": "Step 4",
            "h3": "We talk price with the owner",
            "p": "You tell us what you can pay; we take it to the owner. Most rentals settle in a day. Sales take a week or two."
